# An allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless it is listed here.
#
# The main thing kept out is .venv/: 95 MB built on the Mac, with a python symlink into the
# Mac's home directory and Mach-O .so files (psycopg_binary). Inside a Linux image it would
# break the build, or worse, half-work. Tests, caches and any stray .env file stay out too,
# and a file added to agent/ later stays out until someone adds it here on purpose.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!src
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
